        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hume Auctioneers ? We Get The Pick Of The Crop.\n\nEnjoying a breathtakingly beautiful setting and most desirable location, this outstanding detached bungalow offers a rare opportunity to acquire a home of distinction in this prestigious location.\n\nSet on a beautifully mature site the property enjoys two entrances with separate access to a large and beautiful original Kelly Sheds Barn. There is also an extremely spacious detached concrete-built garage which could easily convert to a multiplicity of uses.\n\nThere is a beautiful and private rear garden.\n\nThe entire is beautifully mature and offers a magnificent sanctuary for family living.\n\nRecently refurbished to an exceptional standard, the beautifully presented interior offers bright, spacious and exceptionally comfortable accommodation throughout.\n\nAt the heart of the home is the impressive open-plan kitchen and dining room. Flooded with natural light, this superb family space features a contemporary fitted kitchen with extensive cabinetry, generous work surfaces and integrated cooking appliances. Large-format tiled flooring flows throughout, while the substantial dining area provides ample room for family dining and entertaining.\n\nThe separate sitting room is particularly inviting, with its generous proportions, attractive timber flooring and numerous windows creating a wonderfully bright and relaxing living space.\nThere are three bedrooms, including an exceptionally spacious principal bedroom, together with two further beautifully presented bedrooms.\n\nThe stylish family bathroom is finished with contemporary tiling and features a modern vanity unit, statement countertop basin and a generous walk-in shower area. A separate utility room provides valuable additional laundry and storage space.\n\nFinished in an attractive contemporary colour palette and enhanced by quality timber internal doors, excellent flooring and an abundance of natural light, this is a warm and welcoming home offering superb accommodation for modern family life.\n\nSituated just minutes from the highly regarded Ratheniska National School, Park Ratheniska GAA, 5 minutes from Stradbally and approx. 10 to Portlaoise, the property offers exceptional convenience.\n\n1gb Fibre Broadband.\n\nViewing Highly Recommended\n"
